<html><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" /></head><body><p style="text-align:center;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:15pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:18pt;color:#2e74b5;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2e74b5"><b> (Use Case Narratives)</b></span></p><p style="margin-top:22.500000000000004pt;margin-bottom:5pt;border:none;border-left:none;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:16pt;color:#2e74b5;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2e74b5"><b>1. مراجعة مهمة منجزة:</b></span></p><table cellspacing="0" border="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-left:0pt;mso-padding-alt:0.7500000000000001pt 0.7500000000000001pt 0.7500000000000001pt 0.7500000000000001pt;border-left:none;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;mso-border-insidev:none;mso-border-insideh:none;"><tr><td width="58" style="width:43.72641363188976pt;background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#333333;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#333333;vertical-align:super"><b>اسم حالة الاستخدام</b></span></p></td><td width="90" style="width:67.13006074680119pt;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">مراجعة مهمة منجزة (Review Completed Task)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width="58" style="width:43.72641363188976pt;background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#333333;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#333333;vertical-align:super"><b>الفاعل الأساسي</b></span></p></td><td width="90" style="width:67.13006074680119pt;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">قائد الفريق (Team Leader)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width="58" style="width:43.72641363188976pt;background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#333333;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#333333;vertical-align:super"><b>الفاعل الثانوي</b></span></p></td><td width="90" style="width:67.13006074680119pt;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">النظام (System)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width="58" style="width:43.72641363188976pt;background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#333333;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#333333;vertical-align:super"><b>الوصف</b></span></p></td><td width="90" style="width:67.13006074680119pt;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">يقوم قائد الفريق بمراجعة مهمة قام عضو الفريق بتغيير حالتها إلى &quot;بانتظار المراجعة&quot; لاتخاذ القرار المناسب.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width="58" style="width:43.72641363188976pt;background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#333333;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#333333;vertical-align:super"><b>الشروط القبلية</b></span></p></td><td width="90" style="width:67.13006074680119pt;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">يجب أن يكون قائد الفريق مسجلاً للدخول، وأن توجد مهمة واحدة على الأقل بحالة &quot;بانتظار المراجعة&quot;.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width="58" style="width:43.72641363188976pt;background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#333333;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#333333;vertical-align:super"><b>السيناريو الأساسي</b></span></p></td><td width="90" style="width:67.13006074680119pt;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">1. يدخل قائد الفريق إلى النظام ويطلب استعراض صفحة المهام.</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><br style="mso-special-character:line-break;"/><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">2. يعرض النظام قائمة المهام، فيختار القائد المهمة التي حالتها &quot;بانتظار المراجعة&quot;.</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><br style="mso-special-character:line-break;"/><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">3. يستعرض القائد تفاصيل المهمة والتحديثات المرفقة.</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><br style="mso-special-character:line-break;"/><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">4. يقرر القائد أن العمل مطابق للمطلوب ويقوم بـ &quot;قبول المهمة&quot;.</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><br style="mso-special-character:line-break;"/><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">5. يقوم النظام بتحديث حالة المهمة إلى &quot;مكتملة&quot; (Completed).</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><br style="mso-special-character:line-break;"/><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">6. يرسل النظام إشعاراً للعضو باكتمال المهمة ويحفظ التحديث. </span></p></td></tr><tr><td width="58" style="width:43.72641363188976pt;background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#333333;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#333333;vertical-align:super"><b>المسارات البديلة</b></span></p></td><td width="90" style="width:67.13006074680119pt;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><b>مسار بديل A (طلب تعديلات):</b></span><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super"> في الخطوة 4، إذا وجد القائد نواقص، يختار &quot;طلب تعديلات إضافية&quot;، ويدخل ملاحظاته، فيقوم النظام بإعادة حالة المهمة للعضو وإرسال إشعار بالملاحظات المطلوبة.</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><br style="mso-special-character:line-break;"/><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><br style="mso-special-character:line-break;"/><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><b>مسار بديل B (رفض التنفيذ):</b></span><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super"> في الخطوة 4، إذا كان العمل خاطئاً تماماً، يختار القائد &quot;رفض التنفيذ&quot;، ويدخل سبب الرفض، فيقوم النظام بتسجيل الرفض وإشعار العضو. </span></p></td></tr><tr><td width="58" style="width:43.72641363188976pt;background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#333333;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#333333;vertical-align:super"><b>الشروط البعدية</b></span></p></td><td width="90" style="width:67.13006074680119pt;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">تتغير حالة المهمة (إلى مكتملة أو تعاد للعضو) ويتم توثيق الإجراء في النظام.</span></p></td></tr></table><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none">&nbsp;</p><p style="margin-top:22.500000000000004pt;margin-bottom:5pt;border:none;border-left:none;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:16pt;color:#2e74b5;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#2e74b5"><b>2. معالجة طلب مساعدة:</b></span></p><table cellspacing="0" border="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-left:0pt;mso-padding-alt:0.7500000000000001pt 0.7500000000000001pt 0.7500000000000001pt 0.7500000000000001pt;border-left:none;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;mso-border-insidev:none;mso-border-insideh:none;"><tr><td width="58" style="width:43.72641363188976pt;background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#333333;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#333333;vertical-align:super"><b>اسم حالة الاستخدام</b></span></p></td><td width="73" style="width:54.57709953248032pt;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">معالجة طلب مساعدة (Handle Help Request)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width="58" style="width:43.72641363188976pt;background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#333333;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#333333;vertical-align:super"><b>الفاعل الأساسي</b></span></p></td><td width="73" style="width:54.57709953248032pt;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">قائد الفريق (Team Leader)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width="58" style="width:43.72641363188976pt;background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#333333;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#333333;vertical-align:super"><b>الفاعل الثانوي</b></span></p></td><td width="73" style="width:54.57709953248032pt;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">عضو الفريق (Team Member)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width="58" style="width:43.72641363188976pt;background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#333333;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#333333;vertical-align:super"><b>الوصف</b></span></p></td><td width="73" style="width:54.57709953248032pt;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">يستعرض قائد الفريق طلب مساعدة أرسله أحد أعضاء فريقه بسبب مشكلة تمنعه من متابعة التنفيذ، ويقدم الحل المناسب.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width="58" style="width:43.72641363188976pt;background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#333333;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#333333;vertical-align:super"><b>الشروط القبلية</b></span></p></td><td width="73" style="width:54.57709953248032pt;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">أن يكون القائد مسجلاً للدخول، ووجود طلب مساعدة مقدم من عضو يواجه مشكلة في مهمته.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width="58" style="width:43.72641363188976pt;background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#333333;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#333333;vertical-align:super"><b>السيناريو الأساسي</b></span></p></td><td width="73" style="width:54.57709953248032pt;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">1. يطلب قائد الفريق استعراض طلبات المساعدة الواردة.</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><br style="mso-special-character:line-break;"/><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">2. يعرض النظام قائمة الطلبات، فيختار القائد طلباً محدداً.</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><br style="mso-special-character:line-break;"/><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">3. يستعرض القائد تفاصيل المشكلة والاحتياجات التي أرسلها العضو.</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><br style="mso-special-character:line-break;"/><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">4. يقرر القائد تقديم &quot;تعليمات توضيحية&quot; ويكتب الحل.</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><br style="mso-special-character:line-break;"/><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">5. يقوم النظام بإرسال التعليمات إلى العضو وتحديث حالة الطلب إلى &quot;تمت المعالجة&quot;. </span></p></td></tr><tr><td width="58" style="width:43.72641363188976pt;background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#333333;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#333333;vertical-align:super"><b>المسارات البديلة</b></span></p></td><td width="73" style="width:54.57709953248032pt;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><b>مسار بديل A (توفير موارد):</b></span><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super"> في الخطوة 4، إذا كانت المشكلة نقصاً في الموارد، يختار القائد &quot;توفير الموارد اللازمة&quot;، ويدخل تفاصيل الموارد الجديدة الممنوحة للعضو، ويحفظ النظام التحديث.</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><br style="mso-special-character:line-break;"/><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><br style="mso-special-character:line-break;"/><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000"><b>مسار بديل B (نقل المهمة):</b></span><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super"> في الخطوة 4، إذا كان العضو غير قادر على إنجازها، يختار القائد &quot;نقل المهمة&quot;، ويحدد عضواً آخر من فريقه، فيقوم النظام بإسناد المهمة للعضو الجديد وإشعار العضوين. </span></p></td></tr><tr><td width="58" style="width:43.72641363188976pt;background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#333333;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#333333;vertical-align:super"><b>الشروط البعدية</b></span></p></td><td width="73" style="width:54.57709953248032pt;padding:9pt 9pt 9pt 9pt;border-left:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-top:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-right:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.7499999999999999pt solid #000000;"><p style="text-align:right;line-height:0.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:22.500000000000004pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none"><span style="font-family:'Arial';font-size:13pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000;vertical-align:super">يتم حل طلب المساعدة وإشعار العضو بالقرار (تعليمات، موارد، أو نقل المهمة).</span></p></td></tr></table><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;border:none;border-left:none;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;mso-border-between:none">&nbsp;</p></body></html>